  "intent": "The speaker plays a beat. Light: the woofer cone kicks out once (the ring jumps wider and the dust cap punches out a beat behind it) and a sound arc leaves each side of the cabinet, fading as it travels out. Strong: two kicks, the second harder, each sending its pair of arcs, and the cabinet jolts with the second. The tweeter stays still.",
